    description: "Found by the 2026-11-24 docstring staleness audit (dev 7e204b35b): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier re-reproduced it on a fixture of its own (reports under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/staleness_audit_11242026/review and verify). Corpus impact not measured. js_ts.py:8222-8226 says JSX <Route> markers are hand-built in _extract_symbols and named after their component; they are built by make_route_symbol (js_ts.py:5562-5572), named for the route. make_route_symbol returns kind function (base.py:1406, 'route is not a symbol kind'), so the 'route' in target.kind in ('function', 'method', 'route') (js_ts.py:8229, 8291) never matches. No output change. r09, v07."  # 089d
